# PharmaEditor AI Enhancement Plan (Phase 2)

This plan outlines the steps to modernize the PharmaEditor platform by migrating to a specific Claude model version, integrating local BERT-based contextual processing, and implementing a massive multilingual dictionary (Tahrirchi.db) with cross-alphabet support.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Model Migration**: We are switching all AI endpoints to use `claude-sonnet-4-20250514` as requested. Ensure your API keys are active for this specific model version.
> [!WARNING]
> **Resource Usage**: BERT integration will require `transformers` and `torch`. This adds ~2GB to the backend environment size and increases RAM usage on startup.

